      ["a big wide basin of water, filled to halfway by the grown-up (the laboratory)", "big test objects, adult-chosen and all far too big for a mouth (a big wooden block, a big sponge, a smooth stone, a big cork or ball, a metal spoon rest, a leaf — six to eight objects, dried and lined up on a tray)", "two sorting towels beside the basin (the FLOAT towel and the SINK towel — the record's results table)", "a drying towel for hands and drips"],
